<div class="dd-help"><section class="dd-help__hero"><div class="dd-help__wrap"><p class="dd-help__eyebrow">BUYER QUESTIONS · PRACTICAL ANSWERS</p><h1>Laser &amp; CNC Equipment FAQ</h1><p class="dd-help__lead">Plan your equipment purchase, sample test and delivery with clear answers about configuration, training and support.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact">Discuss Your Requirements →</a></div></section><div class="dd-help__wrap"><nav class="help-jump" aria-label="FAQ topics"><a href="#selection">Equipment selection</a><a href="#samples">Free sample testing</a><a href="#delivery">Quotation, packing and delivery</a><a href="#support">Training and spare parts</a></nav></div><section class="dd-help__section " id="selection"><div class="dd-help__wrap"><h2>Equipment selection</h2><div class="help-faq"><details><summary>What information helps you recommend a machine?</summary><p>Share your material, thickness, largest part size, artwork and required finish. Tell us whether you need cutting, engraving, marking or printing, together with your production requirements.</p></details><details><summary>How can I compare equipment categories?</summary><p>Start with your application and material. Our category pages explain equipment roles and configuration choices. Review CO2 laser cutters, CNC routers, laser marking machines, fiber laser cutters, laser welders and printers with our team before confirming a model.</p></details><details><summary>Are all accessories in photographs included?</summary><p>No. Product and customer photographs can show different configurations. Review the standard equipment and optional accessories on the product page, then confirm the final supply list in your quotation.</p></details><details><summary>Can you confirm cutting thickness or output from a photograph?</summary><p>A photograph alone does not establish cutting capacity or production output. Share your material and process requirements so we can review a suitable configuration and sample test.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="dd-help__section dd-help__tint" id="samples"><div class="dd-help__wrap"><h2>Free sample testing</h2><div class="help-faq"><details><summary>Can I request a free sample test?</summary><p>Yes. Send your material details, dimensions and artwork. We will discuss the test requirements and suitable equipment with you before arranging the sample test.</p></details><details><summary>Does free sample testing include shipping?</summary><p>Sample shipping arrangements and any related charges are confirmed separately. Please discuss sending your material and returning finished samples with our team.</p></details><details><summary>How should I send artwork or photographs?</summary><p>Send files by email to info@gzcnc-laser.com or through WhatsApp at +86 189 8894 6615. Include your name and project details so we can connect the files with your inquiry.</p></details><details><summary>Can printed, coated or curved items be tested?</summary><p>Describe the substrate, coating, size and shape. Positioning fixtures, rotary accessories, surface preparation and the printing or marking method depend on the item and machine. Confirm these through a sample review.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="dd-help__section " id="delivery"><div class="dd-help__wrap"><h2>Quotation, packing and delivery</h2><div class="help-faq"><details><summary>How do I request a quotation?</summary><p>Submit your requirements through our contact form. Include the equipment of interest, application and destination country. Our team will review your needs and discuss the configuration and quotation.</p></details><details><summary>What is the delivery time?</summary><p>Lead time is agreed individually based on the requirements of each order. Contact us to confirm the schedule for your equipment.</p></details><details><summary>How will my equipment be packed and shipped?</summary><p>Packing and shipping arrangements depend on equipment dimensions, destination and the agreed order terms. Confirm the packing method, transport arrangements and included costs in your quotation.</p></details><details><summary>Can I visit the factory or review equipment before shipment?</summary><p>Our factory is in Guangzhou, China. Send your preferred visit dates and equipment interests. We will confirm the address and arrangements. Discuss any pre-shipment review requirements when confirming the order.</p></details><details><summary>Which conformity documents apply to my machine?</summary><p>Documents apply only to the products and models listed on them. Ask us to confirm the applicable documentation for the exact model and configuration in your quotation. You can review the supplied documents on our Factory page.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="dd-help__section dd-help__tint" id="support"><div class="dd-help__wrap"><h2>Training and spare parts</h2><div class="help-faq"><details><summary>What installation and training support is available?</summary><p>Support includes English manuals and videos, remote installation training and technical assistance. On-site support can be arranged according to the project.</p></details><details><summary>How do I request technical help or spare parts?</summary><p>Contact us with the machine model, serial number if available, a description of the issue and relevant photographs or video. Our team will review the equipment and discuss suitable support or replacement parts.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I confirm warranty and service terms?</summary><p>Ask for the warranty coverage, exclusions, spare-part arrangements and service scope for your specific equipment in the quotation and order documents.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="dd-help__section dd-help__tint"><div class="dd-help__wrap"><h2>Continue planning your project</h2><div class="dd-help__grid"><article class="dd-help__panel"><h3>Compare equipment</h3><p>Review available machine categories and current configurations.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#HomeCategories">Explore Equipment →</a></article><article class="dd-help__panel"><h3>See our factory</h3><p>View workshop photographs, customer visits and conformity documents.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/factory">Factory &amp; Documents →</a></article><article class="dd-help__panel"><h3>Ask your own question</h3><p>Share your application or request a free sample test.</p><a class="dd-help__button" href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact">Contact Our Team</a></article></div></div></section></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":{{ request.origin | json }}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"FAQ","item":{{ canonical_url | json }}}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What information helps you recommend a machine?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Share your material, thickness, largest part size, artwork and required finish. Tell us whether you need cutting, engraving, marking or printing, together with your production requirements."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I compare equipment categories?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Start with your application and material. Our category pages explain equipment roles and configuration choices. Review CO2 laser cutters, CNC routers, laser marking machines, fiber laser cutters, laser welders and printers with our team before confirming a model."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are all accessories in photographs included?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Product and customer photographs can show different configurations. Review the standard equipment and optional accessories on the product page, then confirm the final supply list in your quotation."}},{"@type":"Question